      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ESPECIAL HUGO (1) goes very well this trip starting six times for two wins and two minors. In the money last time at this track (25.49) in a Grade 5, finishing a 8 length second. Makes strong appeal on best. HONEY STIRRER (2) spotted a start but wound up strongly late and finished second and beaten a head (26.31) at Warragul in Grade 5. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in three starts. Leading player again. KRAKEN TOMMY (6) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at Bendigo behind Ascend Igloo (24.00) in a Grade 5. Chased the leaders and with a clean run can be prominent. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from five starts. Bold showing expected. MEXICAN JACK (5) is likely to have admirers.",
